{"text": "Bank reconciliation notes - September 2026\nClient: Magnolia Street Dental Studio, PLLC (Dr. Thaddeus Okoro-Lindgren, DDS)\nAccount: Bayou Teche State Bank operating checking 0113-20-88417, routing 046209881\nPrepared by: Yolanda Fontenot-Park, Crescent Ledger Bookkeeping Co., 10/08/2026\nSummary\nBalance per bank statement at 9/30/2026 was $48,217.63. Deposits in transit are $3,905.00 (merchant batch of 9/30, cleared 10/1). Outstanding checks total $7,494.15, listed below. Adjusted bank balance is $44,628.48. Balance per books is $45,888.48. That leaves $1,260.00 unexplained, and I think I know what it is (item 2).\nOutstanding checks\nCheck\tPayee\tDate\tAmount\n10582\tAcadiana Dental Supply, Inc.\t09/24/2026\t$2,318.40\n10585\tTeche Ridge Properties (rent)\t09/28/2026\t$4,350.00\n10586\tPelican Lab Works\t09/29/2026\t$825.75\n\nItems to discuss with the doctor\n• 1. Wire in, 9/11. Credit of $3,402.00 is a refund from Van der Meer Dentaal B.V. for the returned handpiece (EUR 3,150.00 at the bank's rate). Sender account IBAN NL14 RABO 7479 6435 16, BIC RABONL2U. I booked it against equipment, not income.\n• 2. ATM withdrawals. Five cash withdrawals between 9/4 and 9/26, $200 to $300 each, all at the machine inside Bayou Belle Casino in Breaux Bridge, on the practice debit card ending 8553. That card is the one issued to the office manager, Candace Thibodeaux. They add up to exactly $1,260.00. Nothing in the books for any of them.\n• I asked Candy about it on the phone. She said she \"borrowed against her paycheck\" and will pay it back, and that things have been hard at home since her husband's gambling got bad. I did not press. Dr. O-L needs to hear this from me, not from the bank.\n• 3. Payroll. The 9/15 payroll ACH ($11,204.37) posted twice and the duplicate was reversed 9/17. No action. Q3 Form 941 deposits tie.\n• 4. Card processing. September merchant fees were $612.90; statement rate crept up again.\nNext steps\n• Call Dr. Okoro-Lindgren on his cell, 337-555-0148, before Friday. Not the office line.\n• Recommend he pull the debit card and move Candy off bank access until this is sorted. She has online banking login cthibodeaux_msds.\n• Send him the recon and this memo at his personal address, thad.ol@okorolindgren.example, not the shared office inbox.\nYFP", "kind": "Rich Text document", "detail": "366 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Dr. Thaddeus Okoro-Lindgren", "Candace Thibodeaux", "Candy", "Dr. O-L", "Dr. Okoro-Lindgren"], "companies": ["Magnolia Street Dental Studio", "Bayou Teche State Bank", "Crescent Ledger Bookkeeping Co.", "Acadiana Dental Supply", "Teche Ridge Properties", "Pelican Lab Works", "Acadiana Dental Supply, Inc.", "Bayou Belle Casino", "Van der Meer Dentaal B.V.", "RABO", "okorolindgren"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 28, "end": 42, "text": "September 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "September 2026"}, {"start": 51, "end": 86, "text": "Magnolia Street Dental Studio, PLLC", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Magnolia Street Dental Studio, PLLC"}, {"start": 88, "end": 115, "text": "Dr. Thaddeus Okoro-Lindgren", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Dr. Thaddeus Okoro-Lindgren"}, {"start": 131, "end": 153, "text": "Bayou Teche State Bank", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Bayou Teche State Bank"}, {"start": 173, "end": 186, "text": "0113-20-88417", "kind": "account", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "0113-20-88417"}, {"start": 196, "end": 205, "text": "046209881", "kind": "routing", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "046209881"}, {"start": 219, "end": 240, "te